      "writtenOn": "2026-06-22T15:59:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My plan is to first get the config_chip.h and config.h changes merged. After that, I will cherry-pick config.h to ec-legacy and then replace the old config with the new config on all boards where it is currently defined.\n\nDoes that approach sound okay?",
      "parentUuid": "91957a11_c248616e",
      "revId": "65df57720955f861a555ecca341e8282983a69a6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
